{"3906230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bone fixer shop", "steam_appid": 3906230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/extras/4b15d79d4e69b34c43c631ceb8d7b324.avif?t=1771686246\" width=523 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the will of fate, you were thrown from the human kingdom to the lands of demonic creatures. You found yourself in an abandoned shop for repairing skeletal minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head of a bone repair shop, you have to repair skeletal minions. During the day, you serve customers and repair their skeletal minions, and at night you search for high-quality body parts in the human's kingdom graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to spend rare body parts on repairs in a balanced way, since there are many customers, and body parts are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you experience visions of a mysterious place, where skeletal hands grow as trees and the great skeletal guardian questions your nature!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/extras/e29b58fc1316a709e97547c16834e579.avif?t=1771686246\" width=523 height=256 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/extras/4b15d79d4e69b34c43c631ceb8d7b324.avif?t=1771686246\" width=523 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the will of fate, you were thrown from the human kingdom to the lands of demonic creatures. You found yourself in an abandoned shop for repairing skeletal minions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head of a bone repair shop, you have to repair skeletal minions. During the day, you serve customers and repair their skeletal minions, and at night you search for high-quality body parts in the human's kingdom graveyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to spend rare body parts on repairs in a balanced way, since there are many customers, and body parts are limited.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, you experience visions of a mysterious place, where skeletal hands grow as trees and the great skeletal guardian questions your nature!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/extras/e29b58fc1316a709e97547c16834e579.avif?t=1771686246\" width=523 height=256 /></span></p>", "short_description": "A simple economic simulator of a repair shop for skeletal minions in the land of demonic creatures. You have to balance between fixing skeletons and gathering materials.", "supported_languages": "English, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/12f62e0004aa7d995102f8f03f461078612a6fc4/header.jpg?t=1771686246", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/1e9dc9730a10b9dc07610f3be3777c7e34fd6704/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771686246", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3906230/1e9dc9730a10b9dc07610f3be3777c7e34fd6704/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771686246", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470 / AMD FX-8350 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  GeForce GTX 660 ( 2048 MB) / Radeon R9 270X (4096 MB) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommende